{"id":"570d01ae273edcd2","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-proof-cut-rank.md","title":"证明树切秩与无切性","display":"df-proof-cut-rank — 证明树切秩与无切性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-proof-cut-rank","aliases":["18-df-proof-cut-rank","18-df-035"],"display":"df-proof-cut-rank — 证明树切秩与无切性","depends_on":["[[18-df-proof-tree]]","[[18-df-formula-rank]]"],"verification_status":"supplementary-definition-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-proof-cut-rank"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-proof-cut-rank</span><span>18-df-035</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-proof-cut-rank — 证明树切秩与无切性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"68c5bcff4a164cd8\" href=\"?note=68c5bcff4a164cd8\" title=\"18-df-proof-tree\">18-df-proof-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c39aca33de815fd4\" href=\"?note=c39aca33de815fd4\" title=\"18-df-formula-rank\">18-df-formula-rank</a></span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"supplementary-definition-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T=(N,\\prec,r,\\ell,c)\">\\(\\mathcal T=(N,\\prec,r,\\ell,c)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"68c5bcff4a164cd8\" href=\"?note=68c5bcff4a164cd8\" title=\"18-df-proof-tree\">18-df-proof-tree</a> 的证明树。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{rk}\">\\(\\mathrm{rk}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c39aca33de815fd4\" href=\"?note=c39aca33de815fd4\" title=\"18-df-formula-rank\">18-df-formula-rank</a> 的公式秩；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c(n)=\\ast\">\\(c(n)=\\ast\\)</span> 标记非切规则，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c(n)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(c(n)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> 标记切公式。</p>\n<p>本节引入集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CutNode}_{\\mathcal T}\">\\(\\mathrm{CutNode}_{\\mathcal T}\\)</span>、序数值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{crk}(\\mathcal T)\">\\(\\mathrm{crk}(\\mathcal T)\\)</span> 与谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CutFree}(\\mathcal T)\">\\(\\mathrm{CutFree}(\\mathcal T)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CutNode}_{\\mathcal T}\\coloneqq\\{n\\in N\\mid c(n)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CutNode}_{\\mathcal T}\\coloneqq\\{n\\in N\\mid c(n)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{crk}(\\mathcal T)\\coloneqq\\sup\\bigl(\\{\\mathrm{rk}(c(n))+1\\mid n\\in\\mathrm{CutNode}_{\\mathcal T}\\}\\cup\\{0\\}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{crk}(\\mathcal T)\\coloneqq\\sup\\bigl(\\{\\mathrm{rk}(c(n))+1\\mid n\\in\\mathrm{CutNode}_{\\mathcal T}\\}\\cup\\{0\\}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CutFree}(\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CutNode}_{\\mathcal T}=\\varnothing\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{crk}(\\mathcal T)=0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CutFree}(\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CutNode}_{\\mathcal T}=\\varnothing\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{crk}(\\mathcal T)=0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>局部证明数据的切秩定义。加1确保原子切也被计入；所有秩非负，所以切秩为0恰当且仅当无切节点。它不是半形式关系下标 ρ 的定义替代；后者以每次切公式秩严格小于ρ控制。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"68c5bcff4a164cd8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-formula-rank","status":"resolved","id":"c39aca33de815fd4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-formula-rank]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"68c5bcff4a164cd8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal T=(N,\\prec,r,\\ell,c)$ 是 [[18-df-proof-tree]] 的证明树。$\\mathrm{rk}$ 为 [[18-df-formula-rank]] 的公式秩；$c(n)=\\ast$ 标记非切规则，$c(n)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 标记切公式。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-formula-rank","status":"resolved","id":"c39aca33de815fd4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal T=(N,\\prec,r,\\ell,c)$ 是 [[18-df-proof-tree]] 的证明树。$\\mathrm{rk}$ 为 [[18-df-formula-rank]] 的公式秩；$c(n)=\\ast$ 标记非切规则，$c(n)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 标记切公式。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal T=(N,\\prec,r,\\ell,c)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{rk}","display":false},{"tex":"c(n)=\\ast","display":false},{"tex":"c(n)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CutNode}_{\\mathcal T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{crk}(\\mathcal T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CutFree}(\\mathcal T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CutNode}_{\\mathcal T}\\coloneqq\\{n\\in N\\mid c(n)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{crk}(\\mathcal T)\\coloneqq\\sup\\bigl(\\{\\mathrm{rk}(c(n))+1\\mid n\\in\\mathrm{CutNode}_{\\mathcal T}\\}\\cup\\{0\\}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CutFree}(\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CutNode}_{\\mathcal T}=\\varnothing\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{crk}(\\mathcal T)=0.","display":true}],"bytes":1362,"backlinks":[{"id":"c78f3207eb79266e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[18-df-proof-tree]] 的双边规则集 $\\mathcal P$；空相继式是 $e=\\langle\\varnothing,\\varnothing\\rangle$，$\\mathrm{CutElimination}$ 与 $\\mathrm{CutFree}$ 见 [[18-df-cut-elimination-property]]、[[18-df-proof-cut-rank]]。"},{"id":"25483faf64333446","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal P$ 为 [[18-df-proof-tree]] 的规则实例集；$\\mathrm{CutFree}$ 取 [[18-df-proof-cut-rank]] 的定义。"},{"id":"75fad619adeaa882","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定规则实例集 $\\mathcal P$，$k\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$\\mathcal T,\\mathcal T'$ 为候选证明树。其根、标签与切秩见 [[18-df-proof-tree]]、[[18-df-proof-cut-rank]]。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-proof-cut-rank]]"},{"id":"38164497986e2573","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-44","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-proof-cut-rank]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-79","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-proof-cut-rank]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-77","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-proof-cut-rank|18-df-proof-cut-rank]]"},{"id":"09f8f6fb03023072","anchor":"ref-44","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-proof-cut-rank|18-df-proof-cut-rank]]"}],"outgoing":["68c5bcff4a164cd8","c39aca33de815fd4"]}